Now the applicationset changes.  When I created this thing I really screwed up and didn't include the CRDs with it.  Not sure how to fix that.  So we might as well keep it the same.
helm pull eks-charts/aws-load-balancer-controller --untar
mkdir -p ../rancher-addons/manifests/aws-elbv2/3-4-0/
cp aws-load-balancer-controller/crds/* ../rancher-addons/manifests/aws-elbv2/3-4-0/
rm -rf aws-load-balancer-controllerThe other option to skip the CRDs we can add --include-crds to the helm options which we could try on this release.  Lets look at that at a later date at this point...

